msgid "Hosting"
msgstr "Hébergement"

msgid "How the data is collected"
msgstr "Comment les données sont collectées"

msgid "In the paths, {NET} is mainnet or testnet. Amounts are in duffs (1 DASH = 100,000,000 duffs) except Platform amounts, which are in credits (1 DASH = 100,000,000,000 credits). Times are unix seconds."
msgstr "Dans les chemins, {NET} vaut mainnet ou testnet. Les montants sont en duffs (1 DASH = 100 000 000 duffs), sauf ceux de Platform, en crédits (1 DASH = 100 000 000 000 crédits). Les heures sont en secondes unix."

msgid "Kind of change"
msgstr "Type de changement"

